    "text": "How many compounds are less basic than aniline<br />\r<br />\r<math><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>)</mo></math> <img src=\"assets\\qt0023_a08731894818.png\" /><br />\r<br />\r<math><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>)</mo></math> <img src=\"assets\\qt0023_629bc950101c.png\" /><br />\r<br />\r<math><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>)</mo></math> <img src=\"assets\\qt0023_10f00259fe44.png\" /><br />\r<br />\r<math><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mo>)</mo></math> <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub></math><br />\r<br />\r<math><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mo>)</mo></math> <img src=\"assets\\qt0023_6a86814cbfb7.png\" /><br />\r<br />\r<math><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>)</mo></math> <img src=\"assets\\qt0023_1918c610deb1.png\" />"
